ness, as if trying to forge some consensus. The hint of anticipation in his eyes conveys hope for the outcome of the conversation. The soft light still rests on his face, accentuating skin detail and subtle expressive changes. [shot_5_prompt] Close-up: The close-up of the woman (Person_02) cuts back in. Her gaze remains profound, and the corners of her mouth seem to register a barely perceptible shift — perhaps a suppressed bitter smile, perhaps a sign of acceptance. She does not respond immediately; she internalizes her emotion and stares at the right side of the frame. The shot continues to focus on her complex micro-expressions, conveying emotional tension. The warm tones of the background contrast with her stillness. [shot_6_prompt] Medium shot: The final shot is a wide long view, showing the man (Person_01) and the woman (Person_02) sitting opposite each other in a spacious, brightly lit interior. A table covered with a white cloth separates them, holding two white teacups. Person_01 sits on a beige sofa on the right side of the frame; Person_02 sits in a red single armchair on the left. Both sit upright with composed expressions, sustaining a formal yet richly story-laden conversational atmosphere. The background features a large black-grid glass window showing greenery outside, while the interior is accented with dark-wood furniture, bookshelves, and art pieces. The lighting overall is bright and luminous, evoking an elegant and richly layered space.",
