tains the same seated posture and tailored dark-green plaid suit, eyes firmly directed to the right of frame with a confident, expectant smile. The 'Um, Actually' book in his hand remains clearly visible. Smiling, the host (Person_01) says 'All right, next one.', tone full of command, signaling the show's progression. The wooden structures, glowing props and colorful patterns in the background remain vivid, preserving the show's overall visual style. This shot effectively wraps up the emotional beat and transitions the pacing, as the host confidently moves the show into the next question, building new anticipation for viewers. Please refer to the first image for Person_01, the second and third images for Person_03, and the fourth image for Person_04 in the generated video.",
