ompt] Close shot: The frame again captures a close shot of the man (Person_02). His eyes retain their previous focus and tenderness; the corner of his mouth carries a barely perceptible faint smile. He gazes quietly forward (toward the woman, Person_01), his expression filled with understanding and indulgence, together with the soft warm blurred background creating a serene and warm atmosphere. For the scenes of the generated video, please refer to the first image for shot 1, the second image for shot 2, the third image for shot 3, the fourth image for shot 4, the fifth image for shot 5, and the sixth image for shot 6.",
